     A* System/38 logical file. Same grammar as .lf.
     A* Member: LF38   Compilable: yes (given ACCOUNT)
00010A          R ACCTFMT                   PFILE(ACCOUNT)
00020A            ACCTNO
00030A            ACCTNAME
00040A          K ACCTNAME                  DESCEND
00050A          S ACCTNO                    COMP(GT 0)
